      "short": "have their hosting switched off",
      "fix": "turn the deployment back on in Vercel (check the plan's limits and billing); until then agents get Vercel's page, not your 402"
    },
    {
      "code": "mpp_realm_mismatch",
      "count": 102,
      "why": "name another host as the MPP realm than the one they're served on",
      "short": "name the wrong MPP realm",
      "fix": "set realm to the public host name of the endpoint"
    },
